{"id":"vod_hh_126979","vodId":"126979","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"纯情罗曼史2","name_cn":"纯情罗曼史2","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第12集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/8fc2449dfd43c0ae7a1be455384510cc.jpg"},"summary":"寄宿大学生高桥美咲（樱井孝宏 配音）和大作家宇佐见秋彦（花田光 配音）延续着第一部，仍然继续着他们的恋爱故事。在秋彦的编辑相川小姐和丸川书店的老板的怂恿下，美咲答应参加秋彦的菊川赏得奖纪念酒会。在路途上，美咲意外邂逅了秋彦的哥哥春彦（鸟海浩辅 配音）。小兔老师和家人的关系都很恶劣，夹在中间的美咲左右为难。而难上加难的是，春彦展开了追求美咲的攻势，不是送花就是送草莓，让小兔老师的低气压降到最小值。小兔老师不仅提防着春彦，还得提防着美咲的同学角，但没想到角真正中意的是他自己。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-03-03 12:54:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dyP8Krnb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ejR2o2ye/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/epYgxQVa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/epYgxQQa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ejR2oqve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elYOqRga/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elYOqRMa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/epYgxkpa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dyP8K9Eb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ejR2o0Pe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b4x8NLVb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集完结","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eXD6N55e/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:00.491Z"}